WEBVTT

00:02:29.729 --> 00:02:31.814
I wrote and posted this on Instagram

00:02:31.856 --> 00:02:35.151
about a week after I received
that pathology report:

00:02:35.943 --> 00:02:37.612
"I will keep fighting.

00:02:37.653 --> 00:02:40.031
I will keep loving, I will keep living,

00:02:40.031 --> 00:02:42.491
I will keep loving. I will keep living."

00:02:43.534 --> 00:02:46.621
And then about a week
after that, I wrote this:

00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:52.043
"Fighter.

00:02:52.043 --> 00:02:53.753
I tried it on to see how it felt

00:02:53.753 --> 00:02:56.380
because I kept hearing
those words next to my name,

00:02:56.422 --> 00:02:59.258
like a job, like an identity, like a role.

00:02:59.926 --> 00:03:01.177
Fighter.